{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SwiduxPaywall"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:13SwiduxPaywall09ResilientB7ServiceV16restorePurchasesAA19EntitlementSnapshotVyYaKF","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"restorePurchases","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV","text":"EntitlementSnapshot","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"symbolKind":"method","title":"restorePurchases()","roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/restorePurchases()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/restorepurchases()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"restorePurchases","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/EntitlementSnapshot","text":"EntitlementSnapshot","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A restore is a write: its result is the account’s state as of its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"completion, newer than any read that resolved while it ran — even one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that started later. So it is persisted like a stream event, superseding"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every read still in flight, rather than ordered by when it started."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two things outrank it: a base-stream event persisted after the restore"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"began (the provider’s feed is at least as new), and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/clearCache()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(the restore began for an account the app has since signed out of)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Either way it returns what the cache now holds, as a superseded read"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"does, or throws if nothing usable is cached."}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Restores previously completed purchases, forwarding to the base service."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Persists on success; rethrows on failure (a restore is an explicit user"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"action, so the plugin keeps the prior state)."}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","title":"SwiduxPaywall"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/EntitlementSnapshot":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/entitlementsnapshot","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/EntitlementSnapshot","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"te